# Calibrated sculk sensor = wireless delay line + 10 gt window (category sculk; sculk-2's s1 door).
# The lever click 4 blocks away wakes C 4 gt later; C is active 10 gt (weak power on every side
# but its back), then 10 gt of cooldown. R (delay 1) turns that into a 10 gt window 2 gt later,
# and the observer W watching R fires exactly twice (R's two edges): the A pulses of an elevator.
# The observer V watching the sensor itself fires THREE times (wake, cooldown, inactive): a
# third pulse 20 gt after waking moves things the sensor then hears again (echo).
design designs/gadgets/sculk-delay-line.txt
probe R 5 1 0
probe W 5 2 0
probe V 4 1 -1
quiet 5
use 0 1 0
expect_trace W 000000011000000001100000000000
use 0 1 0
expect_trace V 000001100000000110000000011000
use 0 1 0
expect_trace R 000001111111111000000000000000
